.TH "MODULE-SETTING-LIST" "1" "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
module:setting:list \- List all configuration settings for an SPP module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php module:setting:list
.I <modulename>
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmodule:setting:list\fR inspects a module's manifest \fBsettings:\fR block and renders an
ASCII table detailing each configurable parameter, its data type, active resolved value,
and default fallback.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR <modulename>
Internal name or directory basename of the module.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Retrieves settings definition from \fBModule::getSettingsDefinition()\fR, queries
\fBModuleConfigManager::getConfig()\fR across resolution layers, and renders via \fBCommand::table()\fR.
.SH AUTHOR
Satya Prakash Shukla
